WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.618
Do you like flowers?

2
00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:11.555
What is your favorite flower?

3
00:00:11.556 --> 00:00:14.190
I like tulips.

4
00:00:14.191 --> 00:00:17.723
We went to the flower festival last week.

5
00:00:17.724 --> 00:00:20.513
It was beautiful!

6
00:00:20.514 --> 00:00:23.656
Bada: Can we go on the merry-go-round?

7
00:00:23.657 --> 00:00:25.564
Mom: Not today, Bada.

8
00:00:25.565 --> 00:00:28.745
Today, we are going to see the flowers.

9
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:30.068
Hana: Come on, Bada!

10
00:00:30.069 --> 00:00:32.712
Let's go look at the tulips!

11
00:00:32.713 --> 00:00:38.350
Bada: But I want to go on the merry-go-round.

12
00:00:38.351 --> 00:00:43.572
Hana: Oh, take a picture of me in front of the tulips, please.

13
00:00:43.573 --> 00:00:50.446
Mom: Where is Bada? Bada? Bada?

14
00:00:50.447 --> 00:00:55.998
Dad: Did you know there are over 30,000 flowers here?

15
00:00:55.999 --> 00:01:00.103
Mom: Honey, let's find Bada first.

16
00:01:00.104 --> 00:01:02.389
Dad: Oh, right. Sorry.

17
00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:12.069
Dad: Bada! Bada! He can't be too far away. Bada! Bada!

18
00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:15.861
Hana: Wait! I think I know where he is.

19
00:01:15.862 --> 00:01:18.278
Mom: Bada! Bad boy!

20
00:01:18.279 --> 00:01:20.355
You made us worry.

21
00:01:20.356 --> 00:01:27.290
Bada: I'm sorry. But I wanted to see the merry-go-round.

22
00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:31.473
Hana: Bada, we can go on the rides later.

23
00:01:31.474 --> 00:01:33.936
Bada: Promise?

24
00:01:33.937 --> 00:01:38.337
Hana: Promise. Now let's go see more flowers.

25
00:01:38.338 --> 00:01:44.489
Bada: I'm sorry, Mom and Dad!

26
00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:48.968
After that, even Bada enjoyed the flowers.

27
00:01:48.969 --> 00:01:53.382
Of course we went back to the park to ride the merry-go-round.

28
00:01:53.383 --> 00:01:56.677
So everyone was happy.
